      "marine_snow_falls_continuously_to_the_": "Marine snow falls continuously to the abyssal plain — feeding most life at these depths. Some abyssal sediments are tens of meters thick, accumulated over millions of years.",
      "mark_recapture_visual_photo_id": "Mark-Recapture (visual + photo-ID)",
