      "octopus_play_behavior_has_now_been_doc": "Octopus play behavior has now been documented in multiple species — including with rubber duckies + pill bottles + non-food objects.",
      "octopus_problem_solving_extends_to_mec": "Octopus problem-solving extends to MECHANICAL puzzles — pushing, pulling, twisting. They'll explore new objects extensively before committing to a strategy. Tests show ~70% solve rate on novel mechanical tasks.",
      "octopus_saliva_contains_30_different_t": "Octopus saliva contains 30+ different toxic + paralytic compounds — different combinations are used for different prey.",
      "octopus_saliva_contains_peptides_that_": "Octopus saliva contains peptides that are being investigated as ANALGESICS (pain medications). Some are in early-stage clinical trials.",
      "octopus_senescence_is_controlled_by_th": "Octopus senescence is controlled by the optic gland — removing it lets a brooding female resume eating and live months longer.",
      "octopus_sperm_packets_spermatophores_c": "Octopus sperm packets (spermatophores) contain not just sperm but also nutrient + protective compounds — they're among the most complex spermatophores in any animal.",
      "octopus_sucker_density_by_species": "Octopus Sucker Density by Species",
      "octopus_suckers_are_studded_with_tens_": "Octopus suckers are studded with tens of thousands of chemoreceptor cells, letting an octopus \"taste\" what it touches.",
      "octopus_suckers_grip_via_negative_pres": "Octopus suckers grip via NEGATIVE PRESSURE generated by a small muscular piston in each cup. They can adhere to wet, rough, and irregular surfaces — challenging for conventional adhesives.",
      "octopus_suction_cup_adhesion_is_being_": "Octopus suction-cup adhesion is being engineered into medical patches that adhere to wet tissue — for burn wound dressing + cardiac patches.",
      "octopus_suction_cups_are_inspiring_a_n": "Octopus suction cups are inspiring a new generation of medical adhesives — patches that stick to moist tissue without glue.",
      "octopus_the_ocean_s_intelligent_invert": "Octopus: The Ocean's Intelligent Invertebrate",
